# Content board

Read `.cursor/skills/content-board/SKILL.md` before a content pass.

- `ops/board.json` is the status. Claim the unit before editing, and update it before you finish.
- One place and one stage per run.
- Do not edit page templates, layout, styles, or `src/lib/partners.ts` in a content run.
- Do not set pause or `holdPlaces`. The owner does that.
